1
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:05,084
(Raj:)Mm.

2
00:00:07,507 --> 00:00:08,797
Gentlemen, I put it to you:

3
00:00:08,967 --> 00:00:10,257
(Raj:)The worst tapioca pudding...

4
00:00:10,427 --> 00:00:14,267
(Raj:)...is better than the best pudding
of any other flavor.

5
00:00:15,056 --> 00:00:18,936
(Sheldon:)First off, that is axiomatically wrong
because the best pudding is chocolate.

6
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:24,360
(Sheldon:)Secondly, the organic structure of tapioca
makes it a jiggling bowl of potential death.

7
00:00:24,524 --> 00:00:28,984
(Sheldon:)- It is extracted from the plant...
- Hey, I'm thinking of growing a mustache.

8
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:31,236
Oh, no kidding.

9
00:00:31,406 --> 00:00:34,036
- A Fu Manchu, a handlebar, pencil?
- It's extracted from...

10
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,080
(Howard:)I'm not sure yet.
You know, George Clooney has one now.

11
00:00:37,245 --> 00:00:39,415
(Raj:)Really? I once saw him
shopping at Ralphs.

12
00:00:39,581 --> 00:00:40,911
(Raj:)He was buying tequila.

13
00:00:41,499 --> 00:00:45,629
Wow, you'd think a guy like that
would have some kind of booze lackey.

14
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:50,719
All right, this is cruel.

15
00:00:50,884 --> 00:00:53,514
(Leonard:)We better let him finish
before his head explodes.

16
00:00:53,678 --> 00:00:55,508
All right. Sheldon, why is tapioca...?

17
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,270
(Sheldon:)Tapioca is extracted
from the root of Manihot esculenta.

18
00:00:58,433 --> 00:01:00,313
(Sheldon:)Due to a high concentration of cyanide...

19
00:01:00,477 --> 00:01:06,027
(Sheldon:)...it is poisonous in its raw form
and lethal if prepared improperly.

